Supabase self-hosted assets
Source: https://github.com/supabase/supabase/tree/self-hosted/v0.7.0/docker
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (included as LICENSE).

The source Compose, SQL, gateway, pooler and Edge Function files are bundled
without changes. Nodo adapts the Compose in memory for each new deployment:
- removes global project/container names and auxiliary published ports;
- adds a project-local Realtime hostname/network alias;
- stores database, storage and snippets in project-owned named volumes;
- enables the upstream optional asymmetric auth configuration;
- supplies fresh credentials and key pairs instead of example credentials.

No code or template assets from Dokploy are included. Its public template
structure was consulted as a workflow reference only.
